WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.419 --> 00:00:03.236
Unit three. Mental Health Awareness!

2
00:00:04.189 --> 00:00:07.538
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.588 --> 00:00:10.631
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.681 --> 00:00:14.295
Today we learn about Mental Health Awareness. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.321 --> 00:00:18.988
Mental health. Say it with me. Mental health!

6
00:00:22.482 --> 00:00:26.066
Anxiety. Say it with me. Anxiety!

7
00:00:29.532 --> 00:00:32.398
Mood. Say it with me. Mood!

8
00:00:35.877 --> 00:00:39.761
Coping strategy. Say it with me. Coping strategy!

9
00:00:43.296 --> 00:00:46.963
Self-esteem. Say it with me. Self-esteem!

10
00:00:50.438 --> 00:00:54.338
Support system. Say it with me. Support system!

11
00:00:57.810 --> 00:01:01.410
Therapist. Say it with me. Therapist!

12
00:01:04.948 --> 00:01:08.398
Wellbeing. Say it with me. Wellbeing!

13
00:01:11.924 --> 00:01:23.606
Mental health matters just as much as physical health. Feeling anxiety or a change in mood sometimes is normal, but a coping strategy and a support system help. A therapist can help build self-esteem and overall wellbeing.

14
00:01:23.656 --> 00:01:26.360
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:27.797 --> 00:01:32.764
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:32.814 --> 00:01:33.933
Mood!

17
00:01:34.661 --> 00:01:39.837
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.886 --> 00:01:41.037
Therapist!

19
00:01:42.029 --> 00:01:49.244
Did you know? Around 1 in 7 young people aged 10–19 worldwide live with a mental health condition - you are never alone.

20
00:01:49.294 --> 00:01:51.425
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:52.832 --> 00:02:01.527
Think and answer. What is one healthy coping strategy for stress or anxiety?

22
00:02:01.577 --> 00:02:02.727
Great answer!

23
00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:08.506
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:08.556 --> 00:02:11.019
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

